		margin: 0;
		max-width: 44ch;
		color: var(--u-mute);
	}

	/* Issue #110's panel. Deliberately built out of the same parts as the empty
	   state rather than out of new ones: a checked-out cart is a page with
	   nothing left to do on it, and §8's answer to that is prose and a way out,
	   not a second styling language. EVERY colour here is a token, and since
	   increment 6 deleted the transitional `?error=` panel that is true of the
	   whole page — a test pins that it declares no literal at all. */
	.terminal {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
	}
	/* §3's display face, one step down from the page title — the same rank the
